! Loads (xlsx raw_data): occupancy density m2/person (column M), lighting power density W/m2 (L), plug and process W/m2 (N). The people count of a zone is its floor area divided by the density.
  People,
    Core_ZN_People,               !- Name
    Core_ZN,                      !- Zone or ZoneList or Space or SpaceList Name
    BLDG_OCC_SCH_wo_SB,           !- Number of People Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Occupants', rows 3/4 (Sat/Sun).
    Area/Person,                  !- Number of People Calculation Method
    ,                             !- Number of People
    ,                             !- People per Floor Area
    18.58,                        !- Floor Area per Person {m2/person}  Source: xlsx raw_data!M269 Design Occupancy Density = 18.58 m2/person.
    ,                             !- Fraction Radiant
    ,                             !- Sensible Heat Fraction
    ACTIVITY_SCH;                 !- Activity Level Schedule Name

  Lights,
    Core_ZN_Lights,               !- Name
    Core_ZN,                      !- Zone or ZoneList or Space or SpaceList Name
    ltg_sch_office,               !- Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Lighting', rows 5/6/7 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun).
    Watts/Area,                   !- Design Level Calculation Method
    ,                             !- Lighting Level
    10.6713;                      !- Watts per Floor Area {W/m2}  Source: xlsx raw_data!L269 Lighting Power Density = 10.6713 W/m2.

  ElectricEquipment,
    Core_ZN_Equipment,            !- Name
    Core_ZN,                      !- Zone or ZoneList or Space or SpaceList Name
    BLDG_EQUIP_SCH,               !- Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Electric Equipment', rows 9/10 (Sat/Sun).
    Watts/Area,                   !- Design Level Calculation Method
    ,                             !- Design Level
    6.78;                         !- Watts per Floor Area {W/m2}  Source: xlsx raw_data!N269 Plug and Process = 6.78 W/m2.

  People,
